---
title: Clever Dripper by James Hoffmann
source: https://honestcoffeeguide.com/brew-recipes/james-hoffmann-clever-dripper/
filter: paper
---

@Clever 18g 300g 90°C
grind medium-fine

/rinse
0:00 300g ~10s -- the water goes in first; the page's step says 250g, its preparation 300g
0:10 /add-coffee ~5s
0:15 /stir ~10s -- until all the grounds are wet
2:25 /stir ~8s -- break the crust and let the grounds sink
2:55 /open -- set the Clever on the cup

target 4:00 -- the drawdown takes about a minute
